@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "BasaRx Patients & Medication Safety | Pharmacy Patient Profiles | Pindah";
    ViewData["Description"] = "BasaRx patient profiles — allergy-aware records, active medications, medical aid membership, dispense history, one-click refills, plus MDPCZ doctor and MCAZ medicine lookups.";
    ViewData["Keywords"] = "pharmacy patient management, allergy alerts pharmacy, active medications list, MDPCZ doctor register, MCAZ medicine search, BasaRx patients";
    ViewData["CanonicalUrl"] = "https://pindah.org/basarx/patients";
    ViewData["OgImage"] = "https://storage.pindah.org/IMAGES/pindah-og-default.jpg";
}

<div class="row mb-4">
    <div class="col-12">
        <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
            <ol class="breadcrumb">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/basarx">BasaRx</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item active">Patients</li>
            </ol>
        </nav>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Patients &amp; Medication Safety</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            One person record across the pharmacy counter and the clinic chart — allergies,
            chronic conditions, medical aid, and medication history available wherever you
            dispense or prescribe.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Allergy-aware profiles at the till</h2>
        <p>
            Search or register patients mid-dispense. Profiles carry demographics, national ID,
            allergies, chronic notes, and medical-aid membership into the counter workflow so
            safety cues appear before medicines are confirmed. Active medications and dispense
            history give pharmacists longitudinal context without opening a separate EMR.
        </p>
        <p>
            From the patient sidebar, process a due refill into a new dispense in one action —
            keeping chronic packs tied to the same person and therapy plan.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Shared with clinic and CRM</h2>
        <p>
            Pharmacy patients are customers on the shared ERP — flagged as patients — so billing,
            CRM history, and clinical charting never invent a second identity. When the
            <a href="/basarx/ehr">EHR module</a> is active, the same chart deepens with encounters,
            labs, admissions, consents, and clinical prescriptions using MCAZ medicine search.
        </p>
        <p>
            Prescribers resolve from the local doctor register or MDPCZ public health records,
            including cloud Excel reload for regulated directory freshness.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Safety beyond the label</h2>
        <p>
            Drug-interaction catalogues, dosage cyphers, script attachments, and pharmacist
            verification combine with patient-level allergy data for layered medication safety.
            Reports for patient history and refill compliance close the loop for audits and
            quality improvement.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-12 text-center">
        <p class="small mb-0">
            <a href="/basarx" class="text-decoration-none">← Back to BasaRx</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
